# First Steps for {{ bounty.id }}

Follow these steps in order before writing any code.

## 1. Read the task
```
cat TASK.md
```

## 2. Understand the repo structure
```bash
find . -maxdepth 3 -not -path '*/.git/*' -not -path '*/.venv/*' -not -path '*/node_modules/*' | head -60
cat README.md 2>/dev/null || echo "No README found"
```

## 3. Run existing tests (establish baseline)
```bash
{% if bounty.features and bounty.features.repo_has_tests %}
# Python
python -m pytest -x -q 2>/dev/null \
  || python -m unittest discover -q 2>/dev/null \
  || echo "No pytest/unittest found"

# Node / TypeScript
npm test 2>/dev/null \
  || yarn test 2>/dev/null \
  || echo "No npm/yarn test found"
{% else %}
# No test suite detected automatically — check README for test instructions
grep -i test README.md 2>/dev/null | head -10 || true
{% endif %}
```

## 4. Reproduce the issue
{% if bounty.features and bounty.features.issue_has_reproduction_steps %}
Reproduction steps are provided in TASK.md — follow them exactly.
{% else %}
No reproduction steps were found. Explore the codebase to understand the problem:
```bash
# Search for relevant code
grep -rn "{{ bounty.title[:30] }}" --include="*.py" --include="*.ts" --include="*.js" . 2>/dev/null | head -20
```
{% endif %}

## 5. Make the fix

Apply the minimal change that satisfies the requirements.

## 6. Verify fix
```bash
# Run full test suite
{% if bounty.features and bounty.features.repo_has_tests %}
python -m pytest -x -q 2>/dev/null || npm test 2>/dev/null || yarn test 2>/dev/null
{% else %}
echo "Run tests as appropriate for this project"
{% endif %}
```

## 7. Open PR
Follow CONTRIBUTING.md (if present) for PR format. Reference the issue URL in the PR description:
```
Fixes {{ bounty.url }}
```

## 8. Log outcome in BountyBrain
After the PR outcome is known, record it:
```bash
curl -s -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/outcome \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "bounty_id": "{{ bounty.id }}",
    "status": "merged",
    "payout_received": {{ bounty.features.payout_usd if bounty.features else 0 }},
    "human_hours_actual": 0.0,
    "n_prompts": 0,
    "ephh_actual": 0.0
  }'
```
